  = help: the trait `switchgear_metrics::value::CounterValue` is not implemented for `u64`
  = note: tracing-opentelemetry drops a `counter.` u64 above i64::MAX, so `u64` and `usize` are not accepted
  = note: a Duration is not a counter value: time an operation with `histogram!`, or report a level with `gauge!`
  = note: cast explicitly if you meant it, e.g. `value as i64` or `value as f64`
  = help: the following other types implement trait `switchgear_metrics::value::CounterValue`:
            f32
